# Baked into the bundle at build time by next build — NOT read from Worker
# variables at runtime. Both sites need both URLs: the marketplace links out to
# Personals, and Personals links back (top bar exit, age-gate "Leave").
# Change either one and you must rebuild, not just redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKETPLACE_URL=https://vezlist.vezlistofficial.workers.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_PERSONALS_URL=https://vezlist-personals.vezlistofficial.workers.dev
